{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/1b8d1994a81c03ccbdd315533d7a3139.poster.avif?t=1758818487\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/1b8d1994a81c03ccbdd315533d7a3139.webm?t=1758818487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/1b8d1994a81c03ccbdd315533d7a3139.mp4?t=1758818487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of <i>Duskfade</i> with this special demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Zirian and his trusty mechanical bird, Cuckoo, as you set out on the very first steps of a journey to rescue his sister from the grasp of Despair. The clock has stopped, the night refuses to end, and only by uncovering the secrets of the Master Clockmakers can hope be restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the outskirts of Tick Town, venture into a magical forest alive with danger and mystery, and descend into ancient clockpunk ruins where time itself feels broken. Along the way, unlock new powers like the explosive Blast Attack and the versatile Grapple, blending fluid platforming with fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted foes and prepare for a climactic battle with Wrath, a manifestation of the very fears Zirian must overcome. This demo offers a taste of the heartfelt adventure to come, filled with wonder, challenge, and the courage to step forward into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience a condensed version of the first level, showcasing the fast-paced action platforming, fluid combat, and culminating in an intense boss battle against Wrath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/490f508841ba29b722e20ff3cb13238c.poster.avif?t=1758818487\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/490f508841ba29b722e20ff3cb13238c.webm?t=1758818487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/extras/490f508841ba29b722e20ff3cb13238c.mp4?t=1758818487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short tutorial section to introduce the core mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable areas: the Tick Town outskirts, a magical forest, and an ancient temple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities: the explosive Blast Attack and the versatile Grapple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic intro cutscene with a small glimpse of the overarching story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization is not available in this demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gem collection system is included in a work-in-progress state</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023080?t=1758818487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/7d3264f1d7c897d4f239f81c28e695b2401f391c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758818487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023080/adbbe51e276a6298051a2d